            "sid": "1SA 28:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nĩkwĩthĩwa ndwĩw’aa wasya wa Yeova, na ndwaaĩka Amaleki kwĩanana na ũthilĩku wake mwai, kwondũ wa ũu Yeova nũkwĩkĩte ũndũ ũũ ũmũnthĩ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
